{"id":"prepositions-0065","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 65","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"There\u0027s been a huge rise ___ online shopping.","hint":"rise ___ sth (noun)","explanation":"a rise IN a quantity or activity."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m still waiting for a reply ___ my complaint.","hint":"reply ___ sth","explanation":"a reply TO a letter/complaint/question."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She smiled ___ the waiter and ordered tea.","hint":"smile ___ sb","explanation":"smile AT somebody."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Have you paid ___ the tickets yet?","hint":"pay ___ sth (goods)","explanation":"pay FOR goods/services; pay a bill (no preposition)."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s very fond ___ her nieces.","hint":"fond ___ sb/sth","explanation":"fond OF somebody/something."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Doctors say stress is a major cause ___ insomnia.","hint":"cause ___ sth","explanation":"the cause OF something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The minister refused to comment ___ the scandal.","hint":"comment ___ sth","explanation":"comment ON a topic."},{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Three workers were involved ___ the accident.","hint":"involved ___ sth","explanation":"be involved IN an activity/accident."}]}